  "reflectionText": "Haggai asked the old men who had seen the first house: how do you see it now? Then he said: be strong, Zerubbabel. Be strong, Joshua. Be strong, all you people. And work. Have you ever been told to be strong and work, while you are still standing in the place that was once Solomon's?"
